{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Micro Macro Farm: Enchanted Fields</strong> \u2014 a cozy farming adventure where nature and magic intertwine!<br>Start with a tiny patch of enchanted soil and transform it into a thriving fantasy farm filled with glowing crops, mythical animals, and mysterious machines.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090860/extras/6f9e117d839a159646e3813f0e0dfbba.apng?t=1772811568\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090860/extras/6f9e117d839a159646e3813f0e0dfbba.poster.avif?t=1772811568\" class=\"bb_img\" width=768 height=120 /></picture></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant ordinary seeds and watch them bloom into extraordinary plants \u2014 from fiery Blazefruit Tomatoes to shimmering Everwheat. Each harvest brings you closer to uncovering the secrets of the valley and mastering the art of magical farming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090860/extras/0e891b4f5c4c6ff7a2855e25257dc09f.poster.avif?t=1772811568\" width=640 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090860/extras/0e891b4f5c4c6ff7a2855e25257dc09f.webm?t=1772811568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090860/extras/0e891b4f5c4c6ff7a2855e25257dc09f.mp4?t=1772811568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090860/extras/ab920051a207b19204e77bf03d2da8ac.apng?t=1772811568\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090860/extras/ab920051a207b19204e77bf03d2da8ac.poster.avif?t=1772811568\" class=\"bb_img\" width=768 height=120 /></picture></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tend to your magical livestock \u2014 creatures that gift you enchanted milk, glowing eggs, and other rare ingredients essential for alchemy and cooking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090860/extras/f2ff898f2c48e3dc78e399d235399419.poster.avif?t=1772811568\" width=640 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090860/extras/f2ff898f2c48e3dc78e399d235399419.webm?t=1772811568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090860/extras/f2ff898f2c48e3dc78e399d235399419.mp4?t=1772811568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090860/extras/9e4c94b5df272695b083c22dcb22c1d1.apng?t=1772811568\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090860/extras/9e4c94b5df272695b083c22dcb22c1d1.poster.avif?t=1772811568\" class=\"bb_img\" width=768 height=120 /></picture></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your gathered produce in a variety of mystical machines:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook hearty meals on the <strong>Stove</strong> \ud83c\udf72</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brew potions in your bubbling <strong>Cauldron</strong> \ud83e\uddea</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grind rare herbs with the <strong>Mortar &amp; Pestle</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And refine your goods for greater rewards!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each creation boosts your income and experience \u2014 unlocking even more recipes, seeds, and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090860/extras/7d5e0480041a469079c51a0c12de0c27.poster.avif?t=1772811568\" width=640 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090860/extras/7d5e0480041a469079c51a0c12de0c27.webm?t=1772811568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090860/extras/7d5e0480041a469079c51a0c12de0c27.mp4?t=1772811568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090860/extras/f835612c0a3d64844beb245665fc5dcc.apng?t=1772811568\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090860/extras/f835612c0a3d64844beb245665fc5dcc.poster.avif?t=1772811568\" class=\"bb_img\" width=768 height=120 /></picture></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet friendly farm helpers \u2014 tiny elementals that water crops, harvest plants, and keep your production humming while you rest or plan your next expansion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090860/extras/467a12f8debb5e77464083f568652c55.poster.avif?t=1772811568\" width=640 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090860/extras/467a12f8debb5e77464083f568652c55.webm?t=1772811568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090860/extras/467a12f8debb5e77464083f568652c55.mp4?t=1772811568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A World of Calm and Wonder</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax in a world where time moves at your pace. Listen to the rustling leaves, watch glowing petals drift through moonlight, and feel the quiet magic that lingers in every seed you plant.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy pixel art with a magical twist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25 levels of progression and crafting unlocks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of crops, herbs, and mushrooms to grow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Potions, elixirs, and enchanted meals to craft</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Helpers that automate your tasks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expandable lands with increasing rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Peaceful, relaxing atmosphere</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090860/extras/bbffbb43b45dccc0a36ab5eb1b33383f.poster.avif?t=1772811568\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090860/extras/bbffbb43b45dccc0a36ab5eb1b33383f.webm?t=1772811568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090860/extras/bbffbb43b45dccc0a36ab5eb1b33383f.mp4?t=1772811568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4090860?t=1772811568","background_raw":"https://store.aka